00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:52.829
unbelievable. Aside from the evolution of our Styles and character designs

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:58.590
I think in general with the average quality of animation does improve as time goes on and--this is just a guess--

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:01.320
But I think it's possible because there is an increased number of tools available

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:04.280
